OL,4,ATyphoon Dujuan hits Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong winds caused power cuts for more
OL,7,Fthan 50,000 people, while hundreds of
OL,8,Fflights have been cancelled and rail
OL,9,Fservices have been suspended.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
